    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Managing trauma in the paediatric\npopulation requires specialised skills and expertise. On the 8th of\nOctober 2021, Dr Emaduddin Siddiqui, Associate Professor, Emergency Medicine conducted\na workshop on Paediatric Trauma and Life Support for the hospital's post\ngraduate trainees.",
